# Dangerous infected are encounter variants, not global level scaling. 1.21 adds
# only tactically distinct roles: a new archetype must change decisions, not merely HP.
# Screamer is intentionally fragile and modest in melee; its threat is a telegraphed
# alarm call that draws nearby infected to the call position. Damage interrupts the call.
# Spitter is also fragile: its threat is a telegraphed ranged denial attack that locks
# the ground target at windup start. Moving off that point is the intended counterplay.
# Carrier is the final qualitative role before the balance pass: it is easy to stagger/shove,
